        <mxCell id="boundary" value="ONB-01/02/10 establish the request, authority and current setup. Existing public or B2G use does not prove Sage B2B access.&#10;Keep exact readiness states. Return failed and unknown checks with actions; an uncertain external effect uses SPEC-SEI-004.&#10;Spain policy controls required trust and capabilities. Portfolio clients and unaffected functions retain independent results." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
